<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: CZECH C.BANK SETS FOUR-DAY REPO TENDER.</title>
<headline>CZECH C.BANK SETS FOUR-DAY REPO TENDER.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Czech central bank (CNB) on Thursday set a four-day repo tender at a maximum rate of 75 percent.</p>
<p>The CNB said in a statement that participants in the tender could submit two bids, with the minimum amount of 100 million crowns.</p>
<p>The CNB holds repo tenders to regulate liquidity on the market almost daily.</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 420-2-2423-0003</p>
